Indigo V3 staking schemas, reward calculations, and transaction layout follow
@indigo-labs/indigo-sdk 0.5.13 (MIT), published by Indigo Labs:
https://github.com/IndigoProtocol/indigo-sdk
https://www.npmjs.com/package/@indigo-labs/indigo-sdk/v/0.5.13

Deployment identifiers follow the canonical mainnet V3 system parameters:
https://config.indigoprotocol.io/mainnet/mainnet-system-params-v3.json

The maintained IndigoProtocol/indigo-mcp 0.4.2 uses this SDK version.
Reference-script, manager, and staking-position fixtures are public mainnet
outputs read through Dingo. Transactions evaluate against those deployed scripts.
